          - generic [ref=f1e528]: Narrative dispatch
          - textbox "Write quiet notes from the road..." [ref=f1e529]: Salt spray freezing on black volcanic shingles before midday. The mountains rear straight out of the Norwegian Sea, their granite faces cloaked in powder and sea mist. In Reine and Hamnøy, red rorbuer sit on weathered stilts over slate-green tidepools. Here the silence is interrupted only by the creak of timber and the distant crash of the Arctic swell.
        - generic [ref=f1e530]:
